WEBVTT

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:10.560
Take that.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:14.080
How adorable.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.760
Got you in our sights!

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:19.680
Like taking candy from a...

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:20.800
What?

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.680
Hey, Gru!

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:26.760
Try this on for size!

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.760
That's weird. What is going...

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.440
This is claustrophobic!

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.120
No, no, no!

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:48.040
Too small!
This is too small for me!

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:55.840
I hate that guy!

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:04.280
...and please watch over us,

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:06.240
and bless that we'll have
a good night's sleep.

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:08.240
And bless that
while we're sleeping,

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:10.200
no bugs will crawl into our ears

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:12.440
and lay eggs in our brains.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.320
Great. Thanks for that image,
Edith.

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:18.560
And please bless
that someone will adopt us soon,

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:21.440
and that the mommy and daddy
will be nice

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:23.360
and have a pet unicorn.

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:24.880
Amen.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.680
- Amen.
- Amen.

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:34.520
Unicorns, I love them
Unicorns, I love them

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:38.160
Uni, uni, unicorns
I love them

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:41.720
Uni, unicorns, I could pet one

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:44.080
If they were really real

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:45.240
And they are

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:47.760
So, I bought one so I could pet it

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:50.880
Now it loves me
Now I love it

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:06.840
Don't you... What the...

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.240
Good luck, little girls!

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.320
Whoa! Cool.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:49.240
Hi! We're orphans
from Miss Hattie's Home for Girls.

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:51.160
- I don't care. Beat it!
- Come on!

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:54.400
We're selling cookies
so, you know, we can have a better
future.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:57.200
- Wait, wait! Do you have
coco-nutties? - Yeah.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:20.480
Light bulb.

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:24.720
Dr Nefario!

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:27.880
I'm going to need a dozen tiny
robots disguised as cookies!

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.880
- What?
- Cookie robots!

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:32.280
- Who is this?
- Oh, forget it.

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:41.320
Well, it appears you have cleared
our background check,

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:43.520
Dr Gru.

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:48.720
And I see you have made a list

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:52.400
of some of your personal
achievements.

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:55.160
Thank you for that. I love reading.

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:05.000
And I see you have been given
the Medal of Honor

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:07.120
and a knighthood.

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:10.840
- Me, me, me.
- Me, me, me.

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:12.120
Kevin?

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:15.800
You had your own cooking show

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:19.640
and you can hold your breath
for 30 seconds?

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:21.360
It's not that impressive.

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:24.680
Idiot!

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:29.320
- Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight!
- Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:34.040
What in the name of... What?

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:37.680
Well, here's the dealio.

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:42.480
Things have been so Ionely
since my wife,

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.680
Debbie, passed on.

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:49.720
It's like my heart is a tooth,

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:55.040
and it's got a cavity that can only
be filled with children.

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:56.560
I'm sorry.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:03.800
You are a beautiful woman.
Do you speak Spanish?

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:06.600
Do I look like I speak Spanish?

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:11.800
You have a face como un burro.

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:17.560
Well, thank you!

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.560
Anyway, can we proceed
with this adoption?

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:24.160
So, so excited!

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:29.240
Please tell Margo, Edith and Agnes
to come to the lobby.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.800
I bet the mom is beautiful!

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.880
I bet the daddy's eyes sparkle.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.680
I bet their house is made
of Gummi Bears.

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:41.840
I'm just saying it'd be nice.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:46.040
My caterpillar never turned
into a butterfly.

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:47.680
That's a Cheeto.

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:54.040
Well, Debbie was
a very lucky woman.

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:57.720
Who's Debbie?

00:06:57.800 --> 00:06:59.160
Your wife.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.040
Hi, girls!

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:13.360
Girls, I want you to meet Mr Gru.

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:16.640
He's going to adopt you.

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:19.160
And he's a dentist!

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:22.680
Yeah!

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:30.480
Hi. I'm Margo. This is Edith.

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.760
And that's Agnes.

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:34.720
I got your leg, I got your leg!

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:37.760
Okay, that is enough, little girl.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:40.080
- Let go of my leg. Come on.
You can do it. - Higher!

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:42.360
- Higher!
- Just release your grip. Wow!

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:45.680
How do you remove them?
Is there a command?

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:47.640
Some nonstick spray?

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:50.680
Crowbar?

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:54.960
Okay, girls, let's go.

